      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Shown on rotation in this display case are elements of the uniforms worn
    by King Pedro during the civil war, during which the Siege of Porto (July 1832
    \u2013 August 1833) was the bloodiest period. Because of this symbolic value,
    the museum conserves his Sword, Jacket, Waistcoat and Cap \u2014 given to the
    city of Porto by his daughter Maria II \u2014 as well as the Cocked hat, Sword
    belt, Map case and Binoculars donated by his widow Am\xE9lia to the Museu Portuense."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
